WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.181
(light soft music)

00:00:01.181 --> 00:00:02.317
- [Narrator] In this small town outside

00:00:02.317 --> 00:00:04.567
of Mumbai there's a school.

00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:09.301
And in this school are adorable grannies.

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:12.310
This is India's first
school for grandmothers.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.893
(upbeat music)

00:00:19.328 --> 00:00:20.788
Every day elderly women come

00:00:20.788 --> 00:00:23.349
to a school called Aajibaichi Shala

00:00:23.349 --> 00:00:26.191
for the education they missed
out on earlier in life.

00:00:26.191 --> 00:00:30.274
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.625
Because most girls weren't
allowed to go to school

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.523
they could only dream of an education.

00:00:43.523 --> 00:00:47.606
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:20.000
Unable to sign their names
to important documents

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.871
their whole lives, the women show off

00:01:21.871 --> 00:01:24.930
their signature with great pride today.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.560
And for most of them,
getting to attend school

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.727
is one of the best parts of their day.

00:01:33.346 --> 00:01:37.429
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:55.737
Though the school for grannies
is only a one year program,

00:01:55.737 --> 00:01:58.995
many of the women have plans
to continue their education.

00:01:58.995 --> 00:02:03.078
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:18.267
(light soft music)

